# shell: desktop
# home: fixture
# The both-ways proof, linked-in half: the SAME About descriptor the
# client runner takes out of process is hosted here inside the desktop,
# over workspace-backed services -- and it cannot tell.
wait 15
note the work window covers it: put that away first
key w ctrl
wait 3
click-window About (remote)
wait 3
expect-title About (remote)
note a drag leaves footprints: MOVE paints amber, RELEASE stamps ink
press 400 300
move 430 310
move 450 315
wait 2
release 470 320
wait 6
expect-pixel 450 315 ffcb00
expect-pixel 470 320 000000
note its published menu reaches the strip from inside the process
write /tmp/trk_home/.config/TrackerSettings GlobalMenuBar on
wait 20
click-window About (remote)
wait 4
click 68 8
wait 4
expect-menu Refresh
menu-pick Quit
wait 10
expect-no-title About (remote)
quit
